#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:4
msgid "运动模糊"
msgstr "Motion Blur"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:6
msgid ""
"JAnim 支持对物件开启**时域运动模糊**（temporal motion blur）：渲染一帧时， "
"不再只取一个瞬间，而是在快门时间区间内渲染多个时刻的**完整场景**并取平均。 高速运动的物件会因此拉出与真实相机快门一致的拖影 —— "
"这是真实的快门累积，而不是后处理糊化。"
msgstr ""
"JAnim supports **temporal motion blur** for items: instead of sampling a "
"single instant, each frame renders the **complete scene** at several moments "
"within the shutter interval and averages them. Fast-moving items therefore "
"leave trails that match a real camera shutter — this is true shutter "
"accumulation, not a post-processing smear."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:12
msgid "运动模糊默认不对任何物件生效，需要显式调用 :meth:`~.Item.set_motion_blur` 开启。"
msgstr ""
"Motion blur is not enabled for any item by default; call "
":meth:`~.Item.set_motion_blur` explicitly to turn it on."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:15
msgid "快速上手"
msgstr "Quick Start"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:20
msgid ""
"blurred = Square(0.8, fill_color=BLUE, fill_alpha=1, stroke_alpha=0)\n"
"blurred.set_motion_blur().show()\n"
"blurred.points.shift(LEFT * 2 + UP * 1.2)\n"
"\n"
"sharp = Square(0.8, fill_color=RED, fill_alpha=1, stroke_alpha=0).show()\n"
"sharp.points.shift(LEFT * 2 - UP * 1.2)\n"
"\n"
"Text('set_motion_blur()', font_size=26, color=BLUE).points.move_to([0, "
"2.6, 0]).r.show()\n"
"Text('default: no blur', font_size=26, color=RED).points.move_to([0, "
"-2.6, 0]).r.show()\n"
"\n"
"self.play(\n"
"    blurred.anim(rate_func=linear).points.shift(RIGHT * 4),\n"
"    sharp.anim(rate_func=linear).points.shift(RIGHT * 4),\n"
"    duration=1.6,\n"
")"
msgstr ""
"blurred = Square(0.8, fill_color=BLUE, fill_alpha=1, stroke_alpha=0)\n"
"blurred.set_motion_blur().show()\n"
"blurred.points.shift(LEFT * 2 + UP * 1.2)\n"
"\n"
"sharp = Square(0.8, fill_color=RED, fill_alpha=1, stroke_alpha=0).show()\n"
"sharp.points.shift(LEFT * 2 - UP * 1.2)\n"
"\n"
"Text('set_motion_blur()', font_size=26, color=BLUE).points.move_to([0, "
"2.6, 0]).r.show()\n"
"Text('default: no blur', font_size=26, color=RED).points.move_to([0, "
"-2.6, 0]).r.show()\n"
"\n"
"self.play(\n"
"    blurred.anim(rate_func=linear).points.shift(RIGHT * 4),\n"
"    sharp.anim(rate_func=linear).points.shift(RIGHT * 4),\n"
"    duration=1.6,\n"
")"

