#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:47
msgid ""
"区间内均匀取 ``motion_blur_samples`` 个时间样本，每个样本都重新渲染整个场景， "
"然后在浮点纹理中累加、取平均，最后一次性输出。因此："
msgstr ""
"``motion_blur_samples`` time samples are taken evenly across the interval, "
"each one re-rendering the whole scene, and they are accumulated in a "
"floating-point texture and averaged before being output at once. Therefore:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:50
msgid ""
"**每个样本都是完整场景**，包括遮挡关系、排序、透明度合成， 所以拖影会正确地互相遮挡，也不会出现\"多层叠影导致变亮\"的问题 —— "
"累加使用的是预乘透明度颜色。"
msgstr ""
"**every sample is a complete scene**, including occlusion, sorting and alpha "
"compositing, so trails occlude each other correctly and never become "
"brighter from stacking — the accumulation uses premultiplied alpha colors."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:53
msgid ""
"**只有开启了模糊的物件会按样本时间求值**。未开启的物件被钉在帧中心时刻 ``t``， 但仍然参与每个样本的遮挡与排序。这也是本方案的核心手法："
" 让参照物（网格、文字、背景）保持绝对锐利，只让被摄物拉丝，速度感会更强。"
msgstr ""
"**only items with motion blur enabled are evaluated at the sample times**. "
"Items without it are pinned to the frame's center time ``t``, but still take "
"part in occlusion and sorting of every sample. This is the core technique of "
"the whole approach: keeping the reference frame (grid, text, background) "
"perfectly sharp while only the subject streaks, which reads as much faster."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:56
msgid "**摄像机也按样本时间求值**。如果只移动摄像机而不移动物件， 那么未开启模糊的世界物件会因为摄像机运动而模糊（它们在每一帧的像平面位置变了）。"
msgstr ""
"**the camera is also evaluated at the sample times**. If only the camera "
"moves while items do not, world items without motion blur will still be "
"blurred by the camera motion, because their position on the image plane "
"changes from sample to sample."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:59
msgid "采样时刻按下式计算，并会被裁剪到 ``[0, duration]`` 内，避免动画首尾取到画面之外的时间："
msgstr ""
"The sample times are computed as follows and clamped to ``[0, duration]``, so "
"that the beginning and the end of the animation never sample outside of it:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:61
msgid ""
"sample_t = t + (i + 0.5 - samples / 2) * (exposure / samples)，i = 0, 1, "
"..., samples - 1"
msgstr ""
"sample_t = t + (i + 0.5 - samples / 2) * (exposure / samples), i = 0, 1, "
"..., samples - 1"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:66
msgid "与 :doc:`子时间轴 <sub_timeline>` 的关系"
msgstr "Relationship with :doc:`Sub-timelines <sub_timeline>`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:68
msgid ""
"子时间轴（:meth:`~.BuiltTimeline.to_item`）在主时间轴中作为一个整体物件渲染， "
"每一帧调用子时间轴自己的曝光流程，因此子时间轴内部的 ``set_motion_blur()`` 同样生效。"
msgstr ""
"A sub-timeline (:meth:`~.BuiltTimeline.to_item`) is rendered as a whole item "
"inside the main timeline, and each frame runs the sub-timeline's own exposure "
"pipeline, so ``set_motion_blur()`` inside a sub-timeline works as well."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:71
msgid ""
"实测结论：**子时间轴会继承父层的配置，也可以用自己类上的** ``CONFIG`` **覆盖其中任意一项**。 例如下面的 ``_Lane`` "
"只声明了垂直位置，而父层在 ``build`` 前用 ``with Config(...)`` 为每一条跑道单独指定快门："
msgstr ""
"Measured result: **a sub-timeline inherits the configuration of its parent, "
"and can override any entry through the** ``CONFIG`` **on its own class**. In "
"the example below, ``_Lane`` only receives a vertical position, while the "
"parent assigns a different shutter to each lane via ``with Config(...)`` "
"before calling ``build``:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:75
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"class MotionBlurShutterDemo(Timeline):\n"
"    CONFIG = Config(fps=30, motion_blur_samples=16)\n"
"\n"
"    class _Lane(Timeline):\n"
"        def __init__(self, y: float = 0.0, color: JAnimColor = WHITE):\n"
"            super().__init__()\n"
"            self.y = y\n"
"            self.color = color\n"
"\n"
"        def construct(self) -> None:\n"
"            square = Square(0.75, fill_color=self.color, fill_alpha=1, "
"stroke_alpha=0)\n"
"            square.set_motion_blur().show()\n"
"            square.points.shift(LEFT * 2.4 + UP * self.y)\n"
"            self.play(\n"
"                square.anim(rate_func=linear).points.shift(RIGHT * 4),\n"
"                duration=1.4,\n"
"            )\n"
"\n"
"    def construct(self) -> None:\n"
"        for i, (shutter, color) in enumerate(zip([0, 3, 6], [GREY, BLUE, "
"PURPLE])):\n"
"            y = 2.2 - i * 2.2\n"
"            Text(f'shutter = {shutter}', font_size=26, "
"color=color).points.move_to(\n"
"                [-4.2, y, 0]\n"
"            ).r.show()\n"
"            with Config(motion_blur_shutter=shutter):\n"
"                self._Lane(y, "
"color).build(quiet=True).to_item(keep_last_frame=True).show()\n"
"\n"
"        self.forward(1.4)"
msgstr ""
"class MotionBlurShutterDemo(Timeline):\n"
"    CONFIG = Config(fps=30, motion_blur_samples=16)\n"
"\n"
"    class _Lane(Timeline):\n"
"        def __init__(self, y: float = 0.0, color: JAnimColor = WHITE):\n"
"            super().__init__()\n"
"            self.y = y\n"
"            self.color = color\n"
"\n"
"        def construct(self) -> None:\n"
"            square = Square(0.75, fill_color=self.color, fill_alpha=1, "
"stroke_alpha=0)\n"
"            square.set_motion_blur().show()\n"
"            square.points.shift(LEFT * 2.4 + UP * self.y)\n"
"            self.play(\n"
"                square.anim(rate_func=linear).points.shift(RIGHT * 4),\n"
"                duration=1.4,\n"
"            )\n"
"\n"
"    def construct(self) -> None:\n"
"        for i, (shutter, color) in enumerate(zip([0, 3, 6], [GREY, BLUE, "
"PURPLE])):\n"
"            y = 2.2 - i * 2.2\n"
"            Text(f'shutter = {shutter}', font_size=26, "
"color=color).points.move_to(\n"
"                [-4.2, y, 0]\n"
"            ).r.show()\n"
"            with Config(motion_blur_shutter=shutter):\n"
"                self._Lane(y, "
"color).build(quiet=True).to_item(keep_last_frame=True).show()\n"
"\n"
"        self.forward(1.4)"

