#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:114
msgid "三条跑道的运动完全一致，只是曝光时长不同："
msgstr ""
"The three lanes perform identical motion; only the exposure duration differs:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:116
msgid "``shutter = 0``：等价于不做曝光采样，和没开模糊一样清晰；"
msgstr ""
"``shutter = 0``: equivalent to no exposure sampling at all, just as sharp as "
"without motion blur;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:117
msgid "``shutter = 3``：拖影长度约为物件自身宽度的一半，速度感开始出现；"
msgstr ""
"``shutter = 3``: the trail is about half the item's own width, and a sense of "
"speed begins to appear;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:118
msgid "``shutter = 6``：拖影明显超过物件宽度，开始接近\"光带\"的观感。"
msgstr ""
"``shutter = 6``: the trail clearly exceeds the item's width and starts to "
"look like a band of light."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:120
msgid "这也是运动模糊最容易\"没效果\"的地方 —— **拖影长度取决于曝光期间物件走了多远**："
msgstr ""
"This is also where motion blur most easily appears to \"do nothing\" — **the "
"trail length depends on how far the item travels during the exposure**:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:122
msgid "每帧位移 = 速度 × motion_blur_shutter ÷ fps"
msgstr "displacement per frame = speed × motion_blur_shutter ÷ fps"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:126
msgid "经验法则：把这个位移和被摄物自身的尺寸相比，"
msgstr ""
"Rule of thumb: compare this displacement with the size of the subject itself;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:128
msgid "低于 0.3 倍：几乎看不出来（此时应调大 ``motion_blur_shutter``，或降低 ``fps``）；"
msgstr ""
"below 0.3×: practically invisible (increase ``motion_blur_shutter`` or lower "
"``fps`` in this case);"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:129
msgid "1 ~ 2 倍：最像真实的运动模糊；"
msgstr "1× to 2×: most similar to real motion blur;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:130
msgid "超过 4 倍：糊成一团，只剩下一道光带。"
msgstr "above 4×: a complete smear, leaving only a band of light."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:132
msgid ""
"比如 ``duration=2`` 秒内移动 3.6 个单位（速度 1.8 单位/秒）， 若 "
"``fps=120``、``motion_blur_shutter=1.5``，则每帧只位移 ``1.8 × 1.5 ÷ 120 ≈ "
"0.023`` 个单位 —— 在高分辨率画面里几乎只有一个像素宽， 自然不会看到任何模糊。改用 "
"``fps=30``、``motion_blur_shutter=6`` 就能得到 ``1.8 × 6 ÷ 30 = 0.36`` 个单位的拖影。"
msgstr ""
"For example, moving 3.6 units in ``duration=2`` seconds (a speed of 1.8 "
"units/s): with ``fps=120`` and ``motion_blur_shutter=1.5``, each frame moves "
"only ``1.8 × 1.5 ÷ 120 ≈ 0.023`` units — barely one pixel wide at high "
"resolution, so no blur is visible at all. Switching to ``fps=30`` with "
"``motion_blur_shutter=6`` yields a trail of ``1.8 × 6 ÷ 30 = 0.36`` units."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:139
msgid "与透明度、FrameEffect 共存"
msgstr "Coexistence with Transparency and FrameEffect"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:20
msgid ""
"translucent = Circle(0.5, fill_color=TEAL, fill_alpha=0.5, "
"stroke_alpha=0)\n"
"translucent.set_motion_blur().show()\n"
"translucent.points.shift(LEFT * 2.4 + UP * 1.7)\n"
"\n"
"effected = Square(0.9, fill_color=RED, fill_alpha=0.9, stroke_alpha=0)\n"
"effected.set_motion_blur().show()\n"
"effected.points.shift(LEFT * 2.4)\n"
"\n"
"frozen = Square(0.9, fill_color=GREY_D, fill_alpha=0.95, "
"stroke_alpha=0).show()\n"
"frozen.points.shift(LEFT * 2.4 - UP * 1.7)\n"
"\n"
"SimpleFrameEffect(\n"
"    effected,\n"
"    shader='f_color = frame_texture(v_texcoord); f_color.rgb *= "
"vec3(0.55, 1.0, 0.85);',\n"
").show()\n"
"\n"
"labels = ['translucent + blur', 'FrameEffect + blur', 'not enabled "
"(frozen)']\n"
"for text, y in zip(labels, [1.7, 0, -1.7]):\n"
"    Text(text, font_size=24, color=GREY).points.move_to([4.2, y, "
"0]).r.show()\n"
"\n"
"self.play(\n"
"    translucent.anim(rate_func=linear).points.shift(RIGHT * 4.8),\n"
"    effected.anim(rate_func=linear).points.shift(RIGHT * 4.8),\n"
"    frozen.anim(rate_func=linear).points.shift(RIGHT * 4.8),\n"
"    duration=1.6,\n"
")"
msgstr ""
"translucent = Circle(0.5, fill_color=TEAL, fill_alpha=0.5, "
"stroke_alpha=0)\n"
"translucent.set_motion_blur().show()\n"
"translucent.points.shift(LEFT * 2.4 + UP * 1.7)\n"
"\n"
"effected = Square(0.9, fill_color=RED, fill_alpha=0.9, stroke_alpha=0)\n"
"effected.set_motion_blur().show()\n"
"effected.points.shift(LEFT * 2.4)\n"
"\n"
"frozen = Square(0.9, fill_color=GREY_D, fill_alpha=0.95, "
"stroke_alpha=0).show()\n"
"frozen.points.shift(LEFT * 2.4 - UP * 1.7)\n"
"\n"
"SimpleFrameEffect(\n"
"    effected,\n"
"    shader='f_color = frame_texture(v_texcoord); f_color.rgb *= "
"vec3(0.55, 1.0, 0.85);',\n"
").show()\n"
"\n"
"labels = ['translucent + blur', 'FrameEffect + blur', 'not enabled "
"(frozen)']\n"
"for text, y in zip(labels, [1.7, 0, -1.7]):\n"
"    Text(text, font_size=24, color=GREY).points.move_to([4.2, y, "
"0]).r.show()\n"
"\n"
"self.play(\n"
"    translucent.anim(rate_func=linear).points.shift(RIGHT * 4.8),\n"
"    effected.anim(rate_func=linear).points.shift(RIGHT * 4.8),\n"
"    frozen.anim(rate_func=linear).points.shift(RIGHT * 4.8),\n"
"    duration=1.6,\n"
")"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:57
msgid ":class:`~.SimpleFrameEffect` :class:`~.FrameEffect`"
msgstr ":class:`~.SimpleFrameEffect` :class:`~.FrameEffect`"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:147
msgid "**半透明物件**：每个时间样本的预乘透明度颜色被直接累加再平均， 所以半透明圆在曝光期间是一条颜色一致的浅色带，不会出现\"叠影偏亮\"的瑕疵。"
msgstr ""
"**translucent items**: the premultiplied alpha color of every time sample is "
"accumulated directly and then averaged, so a translucent circle becomes a "
"band of consistent color during the exposure instead of the \"brighter "
"ghosting\" artifact."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:149
msgid ""
"**:class:`~.FrameEffect`**：特效通过渲染代理机制接管其关联物件的渲染， 而代理出的渲染集合会继承当前样本的时间信息， "
"因此被特效包裹的物件同样会被逐样本重新求值，颜色变换后的拖影也是正确的。"
msgstr ""
"**:class:`~.FrameEffect`**: effects take over the rendering of their related "
"items through the render-delegation mechanism, and the delegated render "
"collection inherits the current sample time, so items wrapped in an effect "
"are re-evaluated per sample as well, and their recolored trails are correct."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:152
msgid ""
"**未开启模糊的物件**：它被固定在帧中心时刻，本身保持清晰， 但仍然参与每个样本的遮挡与排序，所以模糊物件在曝光期间覆盖过它的部分仍然是模糊的。"
" 这是有意的取舍 —— 若要严格还原整个动态场景在快门期间的遮挡， 需要让所有相关运动物件都开启模糊。"
msgstr ""
"**items without motion blur**: they are pinned to the frame's center time and "
"stay sharp themselves, but still take part in the occlusion and sorting of "
"every sample, so the parts where a blurred item sweeps over them during the "
"exposure remain blurred. This is a deliberate trade-off — restoring the "
"occlusion of the whole dynamic scene during the shutter exactly would require "
"enabling motion blur on every moving item involved."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:158
msgid "性能与限制"
msgstr "Performance and Limitations"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:160
msgid "渲染开销正比于 ``fps × motion_blur_samples × 帧数``， 每增加一个样本就要把可见场景完整渲染一遍："
msgstr ""
"The rendering cost is proportional to ``fps × motion_blur_samples × frame "
"count``: every extra sample re-renders the visible scene completely:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:163
msgid ""
"只有画面里**确实存在**开启模糊的物件时才会进入多采样流程； 没有任何物件开启模糊（或 ``motion_blur`` "
"全局开关关闭）时，渲染路径与原来完全一致；"
msgstr ""
"the multi-sample pipeline only runs when there **actually is** an item with "
"motion blur in the scene; when no item enables it (or the global "
"``motion_blur`` switch is off), the render path is exactly the same as "
"before;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:165
msgid "``motion_blur_samples=1`` 或 ``motion_blur_shutter=0`` 时也会直接退化为普通渲染；"
msgstr ""
"``motion_blur_samples=1`` or ``motion_blur_shutter=0`` also falls back to "
"plain rendering;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:166
msgid "预览与导出的帧率不同（``preview_fps`` 与 ``fps``）， 在预览里看到的拖影长度与导出结果可能略有差异，以导出为准。"
msgstr ""
"preview and export use different frame rates (``preview_fps`` and ``fps``), "
"so the trail length in the preview may differ slightly from the exported "
"result; trust the export."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:169
msgid "需要注意的限制："
msgstr "Limitations to keep in mind:"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:171
msgid ""
"并没有逐物件的离屏采样。所有参与采样的物件共享同一套快门时刻， 因此无法让同一个画面中的两个物件使用不同的曝光时长 —— "
"需要这种效果时应拆成多个子时间轴，各自设置快门；"
msgstr ""
"there is no per-item offscreen sampling. All sampled items share the same set "
"of shutter times, so two items in the same frame cannot use different "
"exposure durations — split them into separate sub-timelines with their own "
"shutters when this is needed;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:174
msgid ""
"拖影完全来自\"在不同时刻重新渲染\"，因此对 :class:`~.Video` 这类 "
"内容随时间变化的物件，也只是按样本时间取对应的一帧，并不会额外插值；"
msgstr ""
"trails come purely from \"re-rendering at different moments\", so for items "
"whose content changes over time, such as :class:`~.Video`, each sample simply "
"reads the frame at that time without any additional interpolation;"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:176
msgid "采样数与快门都会显著影响导出时间，正式导出前建议先用较低的采样数预览效果。"
msgstr ""
"both the sample count and the shutter significantly affect export time; "
"preview with a lower sample count before the final export."

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:179
msgid "相关 API"
msgstr "Related APIs"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:181
msgid ""
":meth:`~.Item.set_motion_blur` / "
":meth:`~.Item.is_motion_blur_enabled`：物件级开关"
msgstr ""
":meth:`~.Item.set_motion_blur` / "
":meth:`~.Item.is_motion_blur_enabled`: per-item switch"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:182
msgid ":class:`~.Config` 中的 ``motion_blur``：全局总开关"
msgstr "``motion_blur`` in :class:`~.Config`: global switch"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:183
msgid ":class:`~.Config` 中的 ``motion_blur_samples``：每帧的时间样本数"
msgstr ""
"``motion_blur_samples`` in :class:`~.Config`: time samples per frame"

#: ../../source/tutorials/motion_blur.rst:184
msgid ":class:`~.Config` 中的 ``motion_blur_shutter``：快门时长相对于 ``1 / fps`` 的比例"
msgstr ""
"``motion_blur_shutter`` in :class:`~.Config`: shutter duration as a ratio of "
"``1 / fps``"
